e, judgment, and what Aristotle called =E2=80=9Cperception=E2=80=9D. That m=
eans not simply intelligence but the intellectual ability to see the salien=
t features of a specific situation.</em></p><p style=3D"margin:0 0 20px 0;c=
olor:rgb(54,55,55);margin-left:20px;line-height:26px;font-size:16px"><em>Mi=
